            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 1.0.30

- Added editable NHI task descriptions and destinations: Agent tasks open with their full context in the configured agent, while Browser tasks open their configured link.
- Task-board rows and NHI notifications now use the task destination instead of always launching an agent.

]]></description>
